IMPORT prelude
-- EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §8.3: a quantified obligation as an operand of
-- RAND / ROR, beside a plain PARTY obligation. Parenthesised, as the corpus
-- writes compound obligations.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Landlord HAS name IS A STRING
    Tenant   HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign    HAS signer IS AN Actor
    Deliver HAS who    IS AN Actor, what IS A STRING

theLandlord MEANS Landlord OF "Ms Ng"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`sign and deliver` MEANS
    (EVERY Tenant t MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) WITHIN 14 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH)
    RAND
    (PARTY theLandlord MUST Deliver (EXACTLY theLandlord) what WITHIN 14 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH)

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`either way` MEANS
    (EVERY Tenant t MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) WITHIN 14)
    ROR
    (EVERY Tenant t WHO t EQUALS Tenant OF "Alice" MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) WITHIN 7)
